      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "When it comes to high-traffic areas, polished concrete tends to be a low-maintenance option, as it's sealed to prevent scratches and stains, while also being easy to clean with a simple mop and cleaning solution. Luxury Vinyl Tile (LVT) is also a durable option, but it may require more frequent cleaning and maintenance to prevent scratches and scratches, which can show through if the seals wear off. Natural stone is generally durable but requires more maintenance due to porosity, which makes it more prone to stains and damage from heavy foot traffic.",
